	(text "Keys: MX switches (HanElectricity CPG151101D13,\nLCSC C49234235) in CPG151101S11-16 hot-swap sockets, a 1206\nwarm-white LED in each switch's LED slot (3.3 V, 100 R: ~4-6 mA)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1da32171-2b6f-4d04-a6df-5bdb6872ca99")
	)
	(text "Spare pins on J5 (2.54 mm pads for wires): the panel's IO40 and UART0 from H1, the\nco-processor's PA2 and PD7 (NRST), and GND. Test points TP1-TP8 (1.5 mm pads on the back):\n5 V, 3.3 V, GND, I2C and the radar's UART and OUT."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320 160 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "82d802eb-cd7d-45a2-acdb-e83d3d737bc9")
	)
	(text "Power: 5 V from the solder pads (J2) or the optional USB-C (J3), never both and never with\nthe panel's own USB. No reverse-polarity protection: mark + and - clearly. The panel is fed\nthrough J1; U1 makes 3.3 V for the co-processor, radar and SHT40."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "9f30e58c-56e4-436d-b821-0a5ce8671b02")
	)
	(text "Co-processor: CH32V003A4M6 (SOP-16), I2C slave to the panel; the panel polls it.\nSame pins on both boards: PC6/PC7/PC0 = key LEDs (TIM1 remap 1 PWM) or encoder 1 A/B and\nencoder 2 A; PC3/PA1/PC4 = keys 1-3 or encoder 1 push / encoder 2 B / encoder 2 push.\nFlash with a WCH-LinkE on J4 (SWIO, 3V3, GND)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "c9c17939-d647-4adf-bb13-a369685f1879")
	)
	(text "Radar: HLK-LD2402 soldered on its own 2.5 mm header, antenna side out, on a break-away piece centred under key 2 (snap it off to build\nwithout the radar).\nCheck the module's print: 1 VCC, 2 OUT, 3 GND, 4 TX, 5 RX (Hi-Link manual p. 7)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190 165 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d459546d-776c-4dff-b1ab-98839b4b60f5")
	)
